<HTML>
<Title>FAQ Comx 2</Title>
<BODY>
<h1>When I select the 32K RAM card the COMX still states 30K at PR MEM</h1>
<p>
This is correct behaviour, the original 32K RAM card was never supported from BASIC. The extra memory can be used via machine code and/or expansion card commands; see also the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/comx_32kram.html">32K RAM</a> and <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/comx_expansion.html">Expansion Box</a> pages for some additional details.
</p>
</BODY>
</HTML>